<onlyinclude>This '''outline of artificial intelligence''' organizes the field into foundations, problem solving, learning, representation, agents and applications. It provides a structured route through AI rather than a list of individual algorithms.

== Explanation ==
Start with what an intelligent agent observes and does, then study search and reasoning, machine learning and the design of interacting agents. Applications such as language processing and robotics build on combinations of these methods.

